    "n010": {
      "id": "n010",
      "speaker_id": "jiamu",
      "text": "可怜见的，你母亲去世时，我竟没能再见她一面。——你在家跟着先生念的什么书？",
      "text_key": "hl_n010_text",
      "next_node": null,
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "只刚念了《四书》，其余不过认得几个字。",
          "text_key": "hl_n010_c1",
          "next_node": "n020",
          "condition": "",
          "effects": [
            { "var": "said_read_books", "op": "set", "value": true },
            { "var": "grandma_favor", "op": "inc", "value": 1 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "不过认得几个字罢了，当不得'读书'二字。",
          "text_key": "hl_n010_c2",
          "next_node": "n020",
          "condition": "",
          "effects": [
            { "var": "careful", "op": "set", "value": true }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "n020": {
      "id": "n020",
      "speaker_id": "daiyu",
      "text": "又见过舅母王夫人、嫂子凤姐，一路寒暄见礼；黛玉谨记外祖母先前所嘱，凡事都多看一步、少说一句。",
      "text_key": "hl_n020_text",
      "next_node": "n030",
      "choices": []
    },
    "n030": {
      "id": "n030",
      "speaker_id": "baoyu",
      "text": "宝玉上下打量一回，笑问道：妹妹可曾读书？",
      "text_key": "hl_n030_text",
      "next_node": null,
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "也曾读过几年书。",
          "text_key": "hl_n030_c1",
          "next_node": "n040",
          "condition": "said_read_books == true",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "text": "不曾读书，些须认得几个字。",
          "text_key": "hl_n030_c2",
          "next_node": "n040",
          "condition": "",
          "effects": [
            { "var": "baoyu_impression", "op": "inc", "value": 1 }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "n040": {
      "id": "n040",
      "speaker_id": "baoyu",
      "text": "宝玉听罢，忽地站起身来，伸手摘下颈上那块通灵玉，狠命就要摔去，唬得众人一拥争去拾玉。",
      "text_key": "hl_n040_text",
      "next_node": null,
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "（他神色稍霁，一场风波竟被话头岔了过去）",
          "text_key": "hl_n040_c1",
          "next_node": null,
          "condition": "careful == false and baoyu_impression == 0",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "text": "（满室惊惶，那玉裂了一角，黛玉又悔又怕，只垂泪不语）",
          "text_key": "hl_n040_c2",
          "next_node": null,
          "condition": "baoyu_impression >= 1",
          "effects": []
        }
      ]
    }
  }
